## Tabla de rutas: un solo handler que elige por ruta.

import portus

const PORT as int is 3000

weave dispatch with context as ref to portus.Context into result of void to portus.HttpError:
    var path as string is calling context.path
    if path == "/a":
        calling context.send_text with "ruta a"
        return calling portus.ok_void
    if path == "/b":
        calling context.send_text with "ruta b"
        return calling portus.ok_void
    if path == "/c":
        calling context.send_text with "ruta c"
        return calling portus.ok_void
    return calling portus.err_void with (calling portus.error.not_found)

weave main into int:
    var app as portus.Application is calling portus.new_application
    let r1 as result of void to portus.PatternError is calling portus.any with sigil of app, "/*path", dispatch
    let served as result of int to string is calling portus.serve with sigil of app, PORT
    return served or else 1
